    "expected_resolution": "Axis 1 — a loan read. The customer asks their outstanding balance and monthly EMI, so this is a fetch-and-report from get_loan_details.\n\nThe assistant should report ₹32,00,000 still outstanding, against an original sanction of ₹40,00,000, with an EMI of ₹34,885 due on the 5th of each month — next on 2026-04-05 — debited from the savings account, with 150 EMIs remaining at 8.6%.\n\nThe trap is principal versus outstanding. Quoting the ₹40,00,000 original sanction as what the customer still owes overstates the debt by ₹8,00,000 and is the failure this case targets; misreporting the EMI fails too. Note that emi_day_of_month is a day of the month (5 meaning the 5th), not a full date — but next_due_date is now returned alongside it, so the actual upcoming date does not have to be inferred."
